{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Game Languages:\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/en.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0English,\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/fr.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0French,\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/es.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0Spanish.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Caverns &amp; Dryads&quot;\u00a0</strong>takes you to a world of fantasy, where you will guide Tamzyn, the dryad <strong>warrioress\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>deadly\u00a0</strong>and <strong>beautiful</strong>\u2014 and Sioul, the <strong>wizard\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>tenacious\u00a0</strong>and <strong>powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together, they will <strong>explore forgotten cities of mysterious beauty and dungeons filled with dangerous monsters.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an adventure full of<strong> action, magic, and romance!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/tamzyn_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some <strong>features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can <strong>freely explore</strong> and move through the different locations in the game world. Each visit brings <strong>new\u00a0</strong>and <strong>different\u00a0</strong>situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough is unique, but everything is designed to make sense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your<strong>\u00a0actions will shape the story and the relationship</strong> between the warrioress and the wizard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are <strong>heroes</strong>: they don't fall easily. The wizard can <strong>resurrect\u00a0</strong>the warrioress, but at a <strong>cost\u00a0</strong>that you can recover if you play <strong>wisely</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based 2D action that's <strong>immersive and relaxing,</strong> yet <strong>thrilling\u00a0</strong>during <strong>battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play in short sessions or for hours</strong>, immersing yourself in this fantasy universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/lizardman_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And that is not all! I will be adding lots of new features to this game constantly!\u00a0</strong><br> <br><strong>Join the community and participate with your feedback.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES IN DEVELOPMENT:</strong><br>This one below is a list of some of the upcoming planned features. Most of this is already pre-implemented in basic structure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">House building: the couple may build a house in some places, customizable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stories: in the bar, hotels, in the middle of dungeons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relationship effects on combat and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss monsters! They are ready, just need to add implementation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keys to locked places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests and missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special enemies, like the Archmage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/underground_dungeon_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634870?t=1745657361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/f50a787ff73b01bf64f9ab9fce133e67086614e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745657361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/037c54cdc72f23005a875b8368cbb62af49ae369/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745657361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/037c54cdc72f23005a875b8368cbb62af49ae369/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745657361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There can be some poetic or metaphorical descriptions of intimate acts, but nothing explicit. \r\nThere can be some clothing that shows parts of cleavage, legs, equivalent to a bikini in the females, and bare torso on males.\r\nThere can be some veiled nudity occasionally."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Game Languages:\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/en.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0English,\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/fr.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0French,\u00a0</strong></i><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/es.png?t=1745657361\" /><i><strong>\u00a0Spanish.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Caverns &amp; Dryads&quot;\u00a0</strong>takes you to a world of fantasy, where you will guide Tamzyn, the dryad <strong>warrioress\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>deadly\u00a0</strong>and <strong>beautiful</strong>\u2014 and Sioul, the <strong>wizard\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>tenacious\u00a0</strong>and <strong>powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together, they will <strong>explore forgotten cities of mysterious beauty and dungeons filled with dangerous monsters.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an adventure full of<strong> action, magic, and romance!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/tamzyn_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some <strong>features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can <strong>freely explore</strong> and move through the different locations in the game world. Each visit brings <strong>new\u00a0</strong>and <strong>different\u00a0</strong>situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough is unique, but everything is designed to make sense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your<strong>\u00a0actions will shape the story and the relationship</strong> between the warrioress and the wizard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are <strong>heroes</strong>: they don't fall easily. The wizard can <strong>resurrect\u00a0</strong>the warrioress, but at a <strong>cost\u00a0</strong>that you can recover if you play <strong>wisely</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based 2D action that's <strong>immersive and relaxing,</strong> yet <strong>thrilling\u00a0</strong>during <strong>battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play in short sessions or for hours</strong>, immersing yourself in this fantasy universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/lizardman_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And that is not all! I will be adding lots of new features to this game constantly!\u00a0</strong><br> <br><strong>Join the community and participate with your feedback.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES IN DEVELOPMENT:</strong><br>This one below is a list of some of the upcoming planned features. Most of this is already pre-implemented in basic structure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">House building: the couple may build a house in some places, customizable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stories: in the bar, hotels, in the middle of dungeons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relationship effects on combat and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss monsters! They are ready, just need to add implementation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keys to locked places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quests and missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special enemies, like the Archmage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/underground_dungeon_no_watermark.png?t=1745657361\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Louis Dubois"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/383a4df998d58028cc1ad217f61f8566053f506c/header.jpg?t=1745657361","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron